<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Dark Cyber's colours for WinUI's controls. The Fluent brushes come first; then each control's brushes, which
    WinUI's generic.xaml points at Fluent brushes when it loads, are pointed at these again. The second part lists
    every such alias in generic.xaml's dark dictionary, for the controls NeoShell uses, whose target is redefined
    above; the last few are changed by hand.
-->
